{"strongs": "H7553", "word": "רִקְמָה", "translit": "riq.mah", "root": "רצף", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "variegated stuff", "definition": "רִקְמָה noun feminine variegated stuff (woven or embroidered); — absolute ׳ ר Judg 5:30 +; suffix רִקְמָתֵךְ Ezek 16:18 , תָם - Ezek 26:16 dual רִקְמָתַיִם Judg 5:30 plural רְקָמוֺת Ps 45:15 — (piece of) variegated stuff , Judg 5:30 (twice in verse), for garments Ezek 16:10 ; Ezek 16:13 ; Ezek 27:16 ; Ezek 27:24 ; Ps 45:15 explicitly, ׳ בִּגְדֵי ר Ezek 16:18 ; Ezek 26:16 ׳ ר apparently = variegated work Ezek 27:7 figurative of variegated plumage Ezek 17:3 of variegated stone 1Chr 29:2 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8107')\">BDB8107</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7553')\">H7553</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8106')\">BDB8106</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8108')\">BDB8108</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>רִקְמָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>variegated stuff</highlightword> (woven or embroidered); — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 5:30\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,30)\">Judg 5:30</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>רִקְמָתֵךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,18)\">Ezek 16:18</ref>, <bdbheb>תָם</bdbheb>- <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,16)\">Ezek 26:16</ref> dual <bdbheb>רִקְמָתַיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 5:30\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,30)\">Judg 5:30</ref> plural <bdbheb>רְקָמוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 45:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,45,15)\">Ps 45:15</ref> — (piece of) <highlight>variegated stuff</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Judg 5:30\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"30\" oncli